        "strapline": "Really good hotel!",
        "description": "This elegant hotel is nestled on the French Riviera halfway between Saint-Tropez and Cannes in the city of Saint-Raphael.  Visitors might explore the area's beautiful beaches and sheltered coves, try their luck at the casino, or enjoy adventure sports such as kayaking, hiking, climbing and parasailing.\nThe sleek and polished rooms are sound-proofed for a good night's sleep and feature city, pool or marina views.  Guests can relax and rejuvenate in the sauna and solarium, get a workout in the fitness centre, or enjoy a game of billiards in the lounge.  The hotel also offers delicious, healthy Provenal cuisine in the stylish restaurant and six onsite meeting rooms for the convenience of business travellers.  Guests won't have to worry about their environmental footprint as the hotel boasts a European Ecolabel.  This hotel's excellent services and great location make it ideal for a relaxing seaside holiday.",
